ing for any resident who is unable.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0684":{"code":"F-0684","title":"Provide appropriate treatment and care according to orders, resident’s preferences and goals.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0563":{"code":"F-0563","title":"Honor the resident's right to receive visitors of his or her choosing, at the time of his or her choosing.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0689":{"code":"F-0689","title":"Ensure that a nursing home area is free from accident hazards and provides adequate supervision to prevent accidents.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-k0712":{"code":"K-0712","title":"Have simulated fire drills held at unexpected times.","category":"Miscellaneous Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0918":{"code":"K-0918","title":"Have generator or other power source capable of supplying service within 10 seconds.","category":"Gas, Vacuum, and Electrical Systems Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0363":{"code":"K-0363","title":"Install corridor and hallway doors that block smoke.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0923":{"code":"K-0923","title":"Have proper medical gas storage and administration areas.","category":"Gas, Vacuum, and Electrical Systems Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0805":{"code":"F-0805","title":"Ensure each resident receives and the facility provides food prepared in a form designed to meet individual needs